
# GBP NAP Analysis AI Agent - Detailed Design

## Overview

The GBP NAP Analysis AI Agent automatically audits a Google Business Profile (GBP) and evaluates NAP (Name, Address, Phone) consistency across citation sources.

The agent performs:

- GBP data extraction
- Citation discovery
- NAP extraction
- Entity matching
- Duplicate detection
- Consistency scoring
- Competitor benchmarking
- SEO recommendations

---

# Business Objectives

## Primary Goals

1. Verify NAP consistency across the web.
2. Detect duplicate business listings.
3. Identify inaccurate citations.
4. Calculate NAP consistency score.
5. Generate actionable SEO recommendations.

## Expected Outputs

- NAP Audit Report
- Citation Audit Report
- Duplicate Listings Report
- Competitor Benchmark Report
- SEO Recommendations

