# Agent 6: Entity Matching Agent

## Purpose

Determine whether extracted citations belong to the same business.

---

## Name Matching

### Master

```text
ABC Technologies
```

### Citation

```text
ABC Technologies Pvt Ltd
```

### Result

```json
{
  "match": true,
  "confidence": 96
}
```

### Matching Methods

- Levenshtein Distance
- Jaro-Winkler
- Embeddings
- LLM Verification

---

## Address Matching

### Master

```text
123 Main Road Chennai TN 600001
```

### Citation

```text
123 Main Rd Chennai Tamil Nadu 600001
```

### Result

```json
{
  "match": true,
  "confidence": 98
}
```

### Address Normalization

```text
Road → Rd
Street → St
Tamil Nadu → TN
Apartment → Apt
Suite → Ste
```

---

## Phone Matching

### Normalize

```text
+91 9876543210
9876543210
09876543210
```

### Standard Form

```text
9876543210
```

