# Agent 8: NAP Scoring Agent

## Purpose

Calculate citation-level and business-level consistency scores.

---

## Weighting Model

```text
Business Name = 40%
Address       = 40%
Phone         = 20%
```

### Example

```text
Name Match    = 100
Address Match = 90
Phone Match   = 100
```

### Score

```text
(100 × 0.4) +
(90 × 0.4) +
(100 × 0.2)

= 96
```

---

## Business-Level Score

```text
Total Citations = 50
Average Score   = 92
```

## Output

```json
{
  "nap_score": 92
}
```

